  "Demand peak, MW, at 2009's annual energy (National Trends profile)": "Tipukoormus, MW, 2009. aasta aastaenergia juures (National Trends profiil)",
  "Daugava inflow, TWh (TYNDP 2024 as published)": "Daugava sissevool, TWh (TYNDP 2024 avaldatud kujul)",
