  "weight; ranks": "kaal; kohad",
  "TYNDP 2024 Implementation Guidelines; this page's figures": "TYNDP 2024 rakendusjuhised; selle lehe näitajad",
  "the weighted set; the labels of the year chips": "kaalutud komplekt; aastanuppude sildid",
  "The TYNDP 2026 family (National Trends+) does not pick historical years: PECD 4.2 projects the climate of 2025–2054 with three climate models, and ENTSO-E reduces the thirty candidate weather scenarios of each target year to three by a related method — anomalies of six technologies per region, a principal component, k-means with k = 3, the scenario nearest each cluster's average as its representative and the cluster's share as its weight (TYNDP 2026 Scenarios Methodology Report, Tables 34 and 36). The research note <code>docs/research/2026-10-06_climate_years.md</code> has the documents and pages.": "TYNDP 2026 perekond (National Trends+) ei vali ajaloolisi aastaid: PECD 4.2 projitseerib aastate 2025–2054 kliimat kolme kliimamudeliga ja ENTSO-E taandab iga sihtaasta kolmkümmend kandidaatilmastsenaariumi kolmeks sarnase meetodiga — kuue tehnoloogia anomaaliad regiooni kaupa, peakomponent, k-keskmised k = 3-ga, iga klastri keskmisele lähim stsenaarium selle esindajana ja klastri osakaal kaaluna (TYNDP 2026 stsenaariumide metoodika aruanne, tabelid 34 ja 36). Uurimismärkmes <code>docs/research/2026-10-06_climate_years.md</code> on dokumendid ja leheküljed.",

