  "TYNDP 2024 Distributed Energy, whose prices the model's neighbours take": "TYNDP 2024 Distributed Energy, mille hindu mudeli naabrid võtavad",
  ", the owner's value for the opening in place of S1's {mw} MW": ", omaniku väärtus algvaate jaoks S1 {mw} MW asemel",
  "TYNDP 2024 Distributed Energy, {year}: {x} €/MWh, the average price its market model published": "TYNDP 2024 Distributed Energy, {year}: {x} €/MWh, keskmine hind nii, nagu selle turumudel selle avaldas",
  " — the neighbours' profile the Model view takes, before its price levels": " — naabrite profiil, mille Mudeli vaate stsenaariumid võtavad, enne nende hinnataset",
