  "Energy system modelling software on the market today costs <b>tens to hundreds of thousands of euros</b>.": "Turul olev energiasüsteemide modelleerimise tarkvara maksab <b>kümneid kuni sadu tuhandeid eurosid</b>.",
  "<b>The Baltic electricity market is one whole:</b> the model has to compute {ee}Estonia, {lv}Latvia and {lt}Lithuania at once.": "<b>Balti elektriturg on üks tervik:</b> mudel peab arvutama {ee}Eesti, {lv}Läti ja {lt}Leedu korraga.",
